### Create ticket
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student_name": "Amina",
  "email": "amina@example.com",
  "category": "Technical",
  "description": "I cannot access the training portal",
  "priority": "High"
}

### List tickets
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tickets

### Get ticket by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/1

### Update ticket status
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "In Progress"
}
